BULKWAY — Part 1, "After Close"

All visuals (characters, sets, UI cards, captions) and all sound effects and score are generated by code in this
series folder (series/bulkway/assets and part1). No third-party footage, images, music or recordings are used.
The characters are original designs.

Fonts (all SIL Open Font License 1.1, via github.com/google/fonts; licence texts in assets/fonts/)
