Voice
- Kokoro TTS (kokoro-v1.0 ONNX, Apache-2.0), voice am_michael
- Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT) with OpenAI Whisper small.en weights (MIT)

Tools
- Lemo-Opuscar (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT-licensed library code: headless frame renderer,
  TTS/speech-check wrappers, procedural foley helpers (sfx.py), loudness mux. The film is the user's own.
- ffmpeg, Playwright/Chromium, NumPy, SciPy, soundfile, soxr
